## Article 340. Preparation for cassation review

```catala
declaration scope Article340CassationPreparation:
  input check content CassationPreparationCheck
  output hearingPossible content YesNo
  output writtenProceedingPossible content YesNo

scope Article340CassationPreparation:
# Hearing possible when participant requests
  label hearing definition hearingPossible under condition
    check.participantRequestsHearing = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_hearing definition hearingPossible equals No

# Written proceeding possible when case can be decided on existing evidence
  label written definition writtenProceedingPossible under condition
    check.caseCanBeDecidedOnExistingEvidence = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_written definition writtenProceedingPossible equals No
```

## Article 341. Scope of cassation review

```catala
declaration scope Article341CassationScope:
  input check content CassationReviewScopeCheck
  output reviewWithinComplaintGrounds content YesNo
  output mayGoBeyondComplaintGrounds content YesNo
  output newClaimsProhibited content YesNo

scope Article341CassationScope:
# Review within complaint grounds
  label within_grounds definition reviewWithinComplaintGrounds under condition
    check.withinComplaintGrounds = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# May go beyond complaint grounds for mandatory procedural violations or new Supreme Court conclusion
  label beyond_grounds definition mayGoBeyondComplaintGrounds under condition
    check.mandatoryProceduralViolationFound = Yes
    or check.newSupremeCourtConclusionExists = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_beyond definition mayGoBeyondComplaintGrounds equals No

# New claims not raised in first instance are prohibited
  label no_new_claims definition newClaimsProhibited under condition
    check.newClaimsNotRaisedInFirstInstance = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_new_issues definition newClaimsProhibited under condition
    check.newClaimsNotRaisedInFirstInstance = No
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 342. Timeline for cassation review

```catala
declaration scope Article342CassationTimeline:
  input check content CassationTimelineCheck
  output withinTimeLimit content YesNo

scope Article342CassationTimeline:
# Resolution: 60 days from opening
  label resolution_timeline definition withinTimeLimit under condition
    check.appealingResolution = Yes
    and check.daysSinceOpening <= 60
    consequence equals Yes

  label resolution_exceeded definition withinTimeLimit under condition
    check.appealingResolution = Yes
    and check.daysSinceOpening > 60
    consequence equals No

# Ruling: 30 days from opening
  label ruling_timeline definition withinTimeLimit under condition
    check.appealingResolution = No
    and check.daysSinceOpening <= 30
    consequence equals Yes

  label ruling_exceeded definition withinTimeLimit under condition
    check.appealingResolution = No
    and check.daysSinceOpening > 30
    consequence equals No
```

## Article 343. Preliminary review of case

```catala
declaration scope Article343CassationPreliminaryReview:
  input check content CassationPreliminaryReviewCheck
  output leaveUnsatisfiedAtPreliminary content YesNo
  output mandatoryCancellationAtPreliminary content YesNo
  output scheduleForHearing content YesNo
  output fiveDayDeadline content YesNo

scope Article343CassationPreliminaryReview:
# Leave unsatisfied when no cancellation grounds
  label leave_unsatisfied definition leaveUnsatisfiedAtPreliminary under condition
    check.noCancellationGrounds = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_leave definition leaveUnsatisfiedAtPreliminary equals No

# Mandatory cancellation when grounds exist
  label mandatory definition mandatoryCancellationAtPreliminary under condition
    check.mandatoryCancellationApplies = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_mandatory definition mandatoryCancellationAtPreliminary equals No

# Schedule for hearing when at least one judge requests
  label schedule definition scheduleForHearing under condition
    check.atLeastOneJudgeRequestsHearing = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_schedule definition scheduleForHearing equals No

# Five day deadline after report
  label five_days definition fiveDayDeadline equals Yes
```

## Article 344. Cassation review in court hearing

```catala
declaration scope Article344CassationHearing:
  input check content CassationHearingCheck
  output participantsMustBeNotified content YesNo
  output nonAppearanceNotPreclusive content YesNo
  output complainantSpeaksFirst content YesNo

scope Article344CassationHearing:
# Notify participants who requested attendance or court deems necessary
  label must_notify definition participantsMustBeNotified under condition
    check.participantRequestedAttendance = Yes
    or check.courtDeemsAttendanceNecessary = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_notify definition participantsMustBeNotified equals No

# Non-appearance of properly notified participants does not prevent review
  label non_preclusive definition nonAppearanceNotPreclusive equals Yes

# Complainant speaks first; if both sides appealed, plaintiff speaks first
  label complainant_first definition complainantSpeaksFirst under condition
    check.isComplainant = Yes
    and check.isPlaintiff = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label plaintiff_first definition complainantSpeaksFirst under condition
    check.isPlaintiff = Yes
    consequence equals Yes
```

## Article 345. Cassation review in written proceeding

```catala
declaration scope Article345CassationWritten:
  input check content CassationWrittenProceedingCheck
  output writtenProceedingAllowed content YesNo

scope Article345CassationWritten:
# Written when no hearing requests from any participant
  label no_request definition writtenProceedingAllowed under condition
    check.noParticipantRequestsHearing = Yes
    and check.caseCanBeDecidedOnExistingEvidence = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Written when no participant appeared
  label no_appearance definition writtenProceedingAllowed under condition
    check.noParticipantAppeared = Yes
    and check.caseCanBeDecidedOnExistingEvidence = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Written when reviewing rulings
  label reviewing_rulings definition writtenProceedingAllowed under condition
    check.appealingRulings = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Written when reviewing simplified proceeding cases
  label simplified_case definition writtenProceedingAllowed under condition
    check.firstInstanceWasSimplified = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_allowed definition writtenProceedingAllowed equals No
```

## Article 346. Grounds for transfer to chamber, joint chamber or Grand Chamber

```catala
declaration scope Article346CassationTransfer:
  input check content CassationTransferCheck
  output mustTransferToChamber content YesNo
  output mustTransferToJointChamber content YesNo
  output mustTransferToGrandChamber content YesNo
  output mayTransferToGrandChamber content YesNo
  output mustTransferForJurisdiction content YesNo

scope Article346CassationTransfer:
# Transfer to same chamber when departing from chamber conclusion
  label to_chamber definition mustTransferToChamber under condition
    check.needsToDepartFromSameChamberConclusion = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_chamber definition mustTransferToChamber equals No

# Transfer to joint chamber when departing from other chamber conclusion
  label to_joint definition mustTransferToJointChamber under condition
    check.needsToDepartFromOtherChamberConclusion = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_joint definition mustTransferToJointChamber equals No

# Transfer to Grand Chamber when departing from other cassation court conclusion
  label to_grand_cassation definition mustTransferToGrandChamber under condition
    check.needsToDepartFromOtherCassationCourtConclusion = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

# Transfer to Grand Chamber when departing from Grand Chamber conclusion
  label to_grand_chamber definition mustTransferToGrandChamber under condition
    check.needsToDepartFromGrandChamberConclusion = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_grand definition mustTransferToGrandChamber equals No

# May transfer to Grand Chamber for exceptional legal problem
  label exceptional definition mayTransferToGrandChamber under condition
    check.exceptionalLegalProblemExists = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_exceptional definition mayTransferToGrandChamber equals No

# Must transfer to Grand Chamber for jurisdiction violation
  label jurisdiction definition mustTransferForJurisdiction under condition
    check.jurisdictionViolationRaised = Yes
    and check.participantRaisedJurisdictionInFirstInstance = Yes
    and check.jurisdictionViolationSupportedByPrecedent = Yes
    and check.grandChamberAlreadyRuledOnJurisdiction = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label jurisdiction_excused definition mustTransferForJurisdiction under condition
    check.jurisdictionViolationRaised = Yes
    and check.participantRaisedJurisdictionInFirstInstance = No
    consequence equals No

  label jurisdiction_precedent definition mustTransferForJurisdiction under condition
    check.jurisdictionViolationRaised = Yes
    and check.jurisdictionViolationSupportedByPrecedent = No
    consequence equals No

  label jurisdiction_grand_ruled definition mustTransferForJurisdiction under condition
    check.jurisdictionViolationRaised = Yes
    and check.grandChamberAlreadyRuledOnJurisdiction = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label no_jurisdiction definition mustTransferForJurisdiction equals No
```

## Article 347. Procedure for transfer to chamber, joint chamber or Grand Chamber

```catala
declaration scope Article347CassationTransferProcedure:
  input check content CassationTransferProcedureCheck
  output transferDecisionMade content YesNo
  output grandChamberMayDecline content YesNo

scope Article347CassationTransferProcedure:
# Transfer decided by court initiative or participant request, by majority
  label decision definition transferDecisionMade under condition
    check.majorityOfCourtAgrees = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_transfer definition transferDecisionMade equals No

# Grand Chamber may decline transfer
  label decline definition grandChamberMayDecline under condition
    check.grandChamberDeclinesTransfer = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label no_decline definition grandChamberMayDecline equals No
```

## Article 348. Claim withdrawal and reconciliation during cassation

```catala
declaration scope Article348CassationReconciliation:
  input check content CassationReconciliationCheck
  output withdrawalOrReconciliationAllowed content YesNo
  output firstInstanceAndAppealDecisionsInvalidated content YesNo

scope Article348CassationReconciliation:
# Plaintiff may withdraw, parties may reconcile at any time before cassation ends
  label allowed definition withdrawalOrReconciliationAllowed under condition
    check.withdrawalOrReconciliationValid = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_allowed definition withdrawalOrReconciliationAllowed under condition
    check.withdrawalOrReconciliationValid = No
    consequence equals No

# First instance and appeal decisions invalidated upon withdrawal or reconciliation
  label invalidated definition firstInstanceAndAppealDecisionsInvalidated under condition
    check.withdrawalOrReconciliationValid = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label not_invalidated definition firstInstanceAndAppealDecisionsInvalidated equals No
```
